<div class="lab-reports-page bg-white">
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#eff9fd] via-[#f8fcfd] to-white pt-20 pb-12 sm:pt-28 sm:pb-16 text-center border-b border-[#d9f1fc]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#088ae3] bg-[#eff9fd] border border-[#d9f1fc] px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-4 shadow-sm">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#088ae3] animate-pulse"></span>
        Independently Lab Tested
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-[#173b57] tracking-tight leading-[1.08]">
        What the lab reports say.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 sm:mt-5 text-[15px] sm:text-lg text-[#4a6177] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        In water samples tested by independent drinking water laboratories, targeted contaminants returned as Not Detected.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16 bg-[#f8fcfd]">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-7 border border-[#d9f1fc] shadow-sm text-center space-y-2.5 hover:shadow-md hover:border-[#088ae3]/40 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-[#eff9fd] text-[#088ae3] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            {% render 'icon', name: 'shield-check', class: 'w-5 h-5' %}
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#088ae3] uppercase tracking-wider block">Independent Testing</span>
          <span class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-[#173b57] block">SimpleLab</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#4a6177] leading-relaxed">
            Independent laboratory testing for drinking water quality and purity.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-7 border border-[#d9f1fc] shadow-sm text-center space-y-2.5 hover:shadow-md hover:border-[#088ae3]/40 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-[#eff9fd] text-[#088ae3] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            {% render 'icon', name: 'check-circle', class: 'w-5 h-5' %}
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#088ae3] uppercase tracking-wider block">Contaminants Screened</span>
          <span class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-[#173b57] block">Targeted Analytes</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#4a6177] leading-relaxed">
            PFAS forever chemicals, microplastics, lead, arsenic, and nitrates returned as Not Detected.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-7 border border-[#d9f1fc] shadow-sm text-center space-y-2.5 hover:shadow-md hover:border-[#088ae3]/40 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-[#eff9fd] text-[#088ae3] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            {% render 'icon', name: 'sparkles', class: 'w-5 h-5' %}
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#088ae3] uppercase tracking-wider block">Mineralization & Taste</span>
          <span class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-[#173b57] block">7.4 pH · ~50 TDS</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#4a6177] leading-relaxed">
            Lightly mineralized with sodium and potassium for a crisp, balanced taste.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-[#d9f1fc] overflow-hidden shadow-sm mb-16">
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#173b57] to-[#1e486d] text-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[#173b57]">
          <div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#43a5ff] block mb-1">Standardized Protocol</span>
            <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white">
              Analyte Testing Matrix & EPA Benchmark
            </h2>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#d9f1fc]/80 mt-1">
              Independent SimpleLab testing evaluated against U.S. EPA drinking water standards
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#088ae3] text-white text-xs font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-xl shrink-0 shadow-sm border border-white/20">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
            <span>Independently Lab Tested</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-xs sm:text-sm text-left border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-[#f8fcfd] border-b border-[#d9f1fc] text-[#173b57] font-bold">
                <th class="p-4 sm:p-5">Analyte / Target Compound</th>
                <th class="p-4 sm:p-5">EPA Health Standard</th>
                <th class="p-4 sm:p-5">Typical US Tap Average</th>
                <th class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-right">HydroCell™ Result</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-[#d9f1fc] text-[#4a6177]">
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#eff9fd]/50 transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-bold text-[#173b57]">
                  <div class="text-sm">PFAS (PFOA & PFOS Forever Chemicals)</div>
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-normal text-[#4a6177]">Industrial surfactants & Teflon runoff</span>
                </td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-medium">4.0 ng/L</td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#173b57] font-medium">Variable (Detected in many utilities)</td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-right">
                  <span class="inline-block bg-[#eff9fd] text-[#088ae3] border border-[#d9f1fc] px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full font-bold text-xs tracking-wide">
                    NOT DETECTED
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#eff9fd]/50 transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-bold text-[#173b57]">
                  <div class="text-sm">Arsenic (Total Inorganic)</div>
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-normal text-[#4a6177]">Groundwater & bedrock leaching</span>
                </td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-medium">10 µg/L</td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#173b57] font-medium">Variable</td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-right">
                  <span class="inline-block bg-[#eff9fd] text-[#088ae3] border border-[#d9f1fc] px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full font-bold text-xs tracking-wide">
                    NOT DETECTED
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#eff9fd]/50 transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-bold text-[#173b57]">
                  <div class="text-sm">Lead & Heavy Metals (Pb/Cu)</div>
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-normal text-[#4a6177]">Aging municipal delivery piping</span>
                </td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-medium">15 µg/L</td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#173b57] font-medium">Variable (Pipe Dependent)</td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-right">
                  <span class="inline-block bg-[#eff9fd] text-[#088ae3] border border-[#d9f1fc] px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full font-bold text-xs tracking-wide">
                    NOT DETECTED
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#eff9fd]/50 transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-bold text-[#173b57]">
                  <div class="text-sm">Nitrates (NO3-N)</div>
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-normal text-[#4a6177]">Agricultural fertilizer & rural runoff</span>
                </td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-medium">10 mg/L</td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#173b57] font-medium">Variable (Agricultural Runoff)</td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-right">
                  <span class="inline-block bg-[#eff9fd] text-[#088ae3] border border-[#d9f1fc] px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full font-bold text-xs tracking-wide">
                    NOT DETECTED
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#eff9fd]/50 transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-bold text-[#173b57]">
                  <div class="text-sm">Microplastics (>0.01 µm)</div>
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-normal text-[#4a6177]">Single-use plastic bottle packaging shedding</span>
                </td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-medium">0.0 (Advisory)</td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#173b57] font-medium">325 particles/L (Bottled)</td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-right">
                  <span class="inline-block bg-[#eff9fd] text-[#088ae3] border border-[#d9f1fc] px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full font-bold text-xs tracking-wide">
                    NOT DETECTED
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#eff9fd]/50 transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-bold text-[#173b57]">
                  <div class="text-sm">Chlorine, Chloramines & VOCs</div>
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-normal text-[#4a6177]">Municipal chemical disinfectant byproducts</span>
                </td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-medium">4.0 mg/L</td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#173b57] font-medium">Variable (Disinfectant Byproducts)</td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-right">
                  <span class="inline-block bg-[#eff9fd] text-[#088ae3] border border-[#d9f1fc] px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full font-bold text-xs tracking-wide">
                    NOT DETECTED
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#eff9fd]/50 transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-bold text-[#173b57]">
                  <div class="text-sm">Sodium & Potassium (Beneficial Electrolytes)</div>
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-normal text-[#4a6177]">Added post-filtration for optimal taste and alkaline balance</span>
                </td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-medium">Aesthetic Standard</td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#173b57] font-medium">Variable</td>
                <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-right">
                  <span class="inline-block bg-[#eff9fd] text-[#088ae3] border border-[#d9f1fc] px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full font-bold text-xs tracking-wide">
                    LIGHTLY MINERALIZED (~50 TDS)
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 border border-[#d9f1fc] shadow-sm max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4 text-center">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-[#173b57]">
          Independent Testing & Transparency
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4a6177] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          In water samples tested by SimpleLab, targeted contaminants returned as Not Detected. The water is lightly mineralized with sodium and potassium for taste (about 50 TDS, 7.4 pH).
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/pages/contact" class="btn-primary py-2.5 px-6 text-xs font-bold">
            Request Full Lab PDF
          </a>
          <a href="/pages/how-it-works" class="text-xs font-bold text-[#088ae3] hover:text-[#0776c4] flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2">
            Explore 8-Stage Purification Process →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
